      "widgets_values": [
        "GOLDEN GLAMOUR / WAN 2.2 MOTION\n\nFull 20-step native-node workflow. Same image conditions first AND last frames. This encourages a closed cycle but does not guarantee a perfect seam.\n1248 x 544 model canvas, 81 frames at 16 fps. Delivery script crops 2 pixels top and bottom to 1248 x 540 and makes an eased forward/reverse loop.\nChange the image, motion prompt and seed. Models: two Wan 2.2 I2V 14B FP8 experts + UMT5 FP8 + Wan 2.1 VAE. No custom nodes or acceleration LoRAs."
